{"_v":1,"id":"the-elephant-man-2014","cs":75,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":12,"mixed":4,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.vulture.com/2014/12/theater-review-the-elephant-man.html","d":"2014-12-08","q":"This is a beautifully judged Broadway revival, from the sleek design and swift pace to the professionalism of the supporting cast — in particular, Henry Stram as Carr Gomm and Anthony Heald as the bishop."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://nypost.com/2014/12/07/bradley-cooper-shows-off-serious-acting-chops-in-elephant-man/","d":"2014-12-08","q":"The ever-fine Clarkson is a marvel of sympathetic restraint."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/bradley-cooper-elephant-man-theater-754721","d":"2014-12-08","q":"His performance is staggering in its physical discipline, its piercing emotional transparency and, most surprisingly, its restraint."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.nytimes.com/2014/12/08/theater/bradley-cooper-in-the-elephant-man-on-broadway.html?_r=0","d":"2014-12-07","q":"Mr. Cooper brings a mixture of childlike wonder and adult anguish to John Merrick that makes you forget you're watching a movie star slumming on Broadway."},{"cn":"Alexis Soloski","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2014/dec/08/the-elephant-man-bradley-cooper-review","d":"2014-12-08","q":"But the play that surrounds him has come to seem somewhat brittle and artificial."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/the-elephant-man-1","q":"However, strong acting cannot soften wooden dialogue or smooth bumpy transitions."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"http://www.usatoday.com/story/life/theater/2014/12/07/broadway-review-the-elephant-man/20000033/","d":"2014-12-08","q":"It's no slight to Cooper, in fact, to say that this gorgeous Elephant Man is a shared achievement."},{"cn":"Robert Kahn","o":"NBC New York","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.nbcnewyork.com/entertainment/the-scene/review-elephant-man-cooper-284975661.html","d":"2014-12-07","q":"This “Elephant Man” will be best remembered for its deeply committed performance by Cooper, who joins a long line of actors"},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"http://www.nydailynews.com/entertainment/theater-arts/bradley-cooper-memorable-elephant-man-article-1.2035048","q":"What's really on view are man's inhumanity and a topnotch Cooper."},{"cn":"Linda Winder","o":"Newsday","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/the-elephant-man-review-a-stellar-bradley-cooper-1.9685494","q":"And we say good for him and his smashing, heart-ripping portrayal."},{"cn":"Tom Teodorczuk","o":"The Independent","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/the-elephant-man-theatre-review-bradley-cooper-plays-part-of-childhood-dreams-to-perfection-9909332.html","q":"He shines as Merrick, never overplaying his grotesqueness."},{"cn":"Roma Torre","o":"NY1","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.ny1.com/content/lifestyles/theater_reviews/220047/theater-review---the-elephant-man-/","d":"2014-12-07","q":"There's still much to admire about Scott Ellis' tautly polished production."},{"cn":"Jason Clark","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20364394_20880003,00.html","d":"2014-12-07","q":"Cooperemploying a lilting, singsongy gentleman's English to suggest the gentle Merrickowns this production."},{"cn":"Robert Hofler","o":"TheWrap","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"http://www.thewrap.com/bradley-cooper-in-the-elephant-man-offers-gorgeous-along-with-the-beast/","q":"Cooper can’t be blamed, however, for playing Merrick the way Pomerance wrote him: The guy is a saintly bore."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.amny.com/entertainment/the-elephant-man-review-cooper-scores-1.9690405","d":"2014-12-07","q":"But even if the play lacks narrative power, the setup is still fascinating."},{"cn":"Kathleen Campion","o":"Front Row Center","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2014/12/the-elephant-man/","d":"2014-12-08","q":"That said, each of these actors very much belongs on a Broadway stage."}],"au":{"score":88,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"mz":{"s":89,"c":20,"sr":4.5},"ss":{"s":88,"c":106}}},"ta":"222 W 45th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2014-11-07","ca":[{"n":"Patricia Clarkson","r":"Mrs. Kendal"},{"n":"Bradley Cooper","r":"John Merrick"},{"n":"Alessandro Nivola","r":"Frederick Treves"},{"n":"Anthony Heald","r":"Ross"},{"n":"Chris Bannow","r":"Pinhead"},{"n":"Peter Bradbury","r":"Orderly"},{"n":"Eric Clem","r":"English Policeman"},{"n":"Scott Lowell","r":"Snork"},{"n":"Amanda Lea Mason","r":"Pinhead"},{"n":"Kathryn Meisle","r":"Ms. Sandwich"},{"n":"Marguerite Stimpson","r":"Duchess"},{"n":"Henry Stram","r":"Carr Gomm"},{"n":"Emma Thorne","r":"Nurse"}]}